WEBVTT

00:04:28.698 --> 00:04:31.654
You know, the basics
like multiplication tables.

00:04:33.514 --> 00:04:38.234
I remember I struggled every night
to figure out lessons for my students.

00:04:38.754 --> 00:04:40.504
I was hating it.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:45.614
And I was afraid if I didn't do well,
I might not make it.

00:04:48.014 --> 00:04:51.964
But the more I worked on it,

00:04:52.534 --> 00:04:56.478
trying to make it interesting,
trying to make it fun,

00:04:56.478 --> 00:05:00.065
the more I realized
the pattern in these numbers.